E}さんですよね？ちょっとお待ちを！","nextNodeIds":[752190102]},{"nodeId":752190102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6476,"speakerName":"フチル","textMapHash":1846806202,"text":"これを…","nextNodeIds":[752190103]},{"nodeId":752190103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":524035610,"text":"ん？オイラたちに頼みたいことでもあるのか？","nextNodeIds":[752190104]},{"nodeId":752190104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6476,"speakerName":"フチル","textMapHash":2869484898,"text":"ははっ、いえ。あなたたち宛てのお荷物を預かってるんです。どこに行けばお会いできるか、考えていたところで——","nextNodeIds":[752190105]},{"nodeId":752190105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6476,"speakerName":"フチル","textMapHash":3802946130,"text":"まさかバッタリ出会えるなんてね。","nextNodeIds":[752190106]},{"nodeId":752190106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4142054890,"text":"荷物？誰からだろう？","nextNodeIds":[752190107]},{"nodeId":752190107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6476,"speakerName":"フチル","textMapHash":2841419682,"text":"この荷物は、長い長い旅を経て届いたんですよ。色んな人たちの手を経て、つい先日、冒険者協会から懸木の民の伝達使に渡されたんです…","nextNodeIds":[752190108]},{"nodeId":752190108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6476,"speakerName":"フチル","textMapHash":1367528858,"text":"このところ、ナタも落ち着かなくて、キャラバンの往来もしばらく途絶えてたので…差出人は書かれてませんが、消印を見るに、フォンテーヌからみたいですね。","nextNodeIds":[752190109]},{"nodeId":752190109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6476,"speakerName":"フチル","textMapHash":3185898746,"text":"フォンテーヌにもお友達がたくさんいらっしゃるんですね。","nextNodeIds":[752190110,752190111]},{"nodeId":752190110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3988186506,"text":"届けてくれてありがとう。","nextNodeIds":[752190112]},{"nodeId":752190112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6476,"speakerName":"フチル","textMapHash":127493698,"text":"はい、こんなに早く配達できるなんて、今日はいい一日になりそうです！炎神さまのご加護のおかげですね。","nextNodeIds":[752190113]},{"nodeId":752190113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6476,"speakerName":"フチル","textMapHash":2549760194,"text":"じゃあ、私は次の配達があるので。あなたがたもいい一日になりますように！","nextNodeIds":[752190114]},{"nodeId":752190114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2707190954,"text":"おう、仕事頑張れよ！","nextNodeIds":[752190115]},{"nodeId":752190115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3752947682,"text":"う～ん、フォンテーヌからか。軽そうだし、荷物っていうより、手紙か…？","nextNodeIds":[752190116]},{"nodeId":752190116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2483508194,"text":"開けてみようぜ！","nextNodeIds":[752190117]},{"nodeId":752190117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1670366114,"text":"わぁ、シャルロットからだ！これは…フォンテーヌを離れる時に撮ってくれた写真だな。","nextNodeIds":[752190118]},{"nodeId":752190118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3378028114,"text":"ついこの間なのに、なんか、すごく昔のことみたいに感じるぞ。","nextNodeIds":[752190119]},{"nodeId":752190119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1959084290,"text":"へへっ、大事にしまっとこうぜ！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":752190111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2116555506,"text":"無事、配達完了だね！","nextNodeIds":[752190112]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7521901,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["7521601","1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_SET_QUEST_GLOBAL_VAR"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7521901],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerI